  "question": {
    "text": "Let $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$ and $B=I+\\operatorname{adj}(A)+(\\operatorname{adj} A)^2+\\ldots+(\\operatorname{adj} A)^{10}$. Then, the sum of all the elements of the matrix $B$ is:"
  },
